<title>USA: Bio-Technology General 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bio-Technology General 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.47		    $0.11</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.45			N/A</p>
<p> Net			 22,915		    4,779</p>
<p> Revs			47,738		   27,960</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	48,259		   43,784</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	50,704			N/A</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Bio-Technology General Corp.</p>
<p>1996 results include one-time tax benefit of $12.0 million from launch of Oxandrin product.  Excluding the gain, net income per share would have been $0.23 per share for the year.</p>
<p>Per-quarter results not provided.</p>
